<title>USA: Group cuts Spreckels stake to 5.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Group cuts Spreckels stake to 5.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Bedford Falls Investors L.P. and Metropolitan Capital Advisors Inc said Tuesday it reduced its stake in Spreckels Industries Inc to 5.5 percent or 345,933 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it sold 153,000 shares of Spreckels from Sept 26 to 30 at $23.125 to $23.211 per share.</p>
